SUMMARY:Zeiss Lightfield 4D and LSM 990 Airyscan Demo
DESCRIPTION:From Paul Tang: Zeiss demonstrating Lightfield 4D imaging system - captures fast 3D images from thick fluorescent samples (zebrafish, organoids, tissue slices).\n\nOrganised by Matthieu Vermeren. Demo by Daniel Soong in the Zebrafish Imaging Facility.\n\nZeiss bringing Krispy Kreme donuts!\n\n⚠️ Contact Daniel Soong to test the system. Fill in form for time slot. Krispy Kreme donuts provided!
LOCATION:Zebrafish Imaging Facility, Chancellors Building
